cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this work helps yours, please cite it as below."
title: "flickering-sign: an autonomous brain from Laya and an LLM"
abstract: >-
  An autonomous brain packaged as a bundle: Laya as a fast System 1, any
  OpenAI-compatible LLM as a slow, asynchronous System 2, config-declared drives
  and neuromodulator dials over one event stream, a hippocampus with sleep
  consolidation, and a cerebellum whose learning progress is the only relief from
  boredom. Curiosity is not a module: the experiment watches whether it emerges.
type: software
